{"seq":1,"slug":"infrastructure-integration-tests","title":"基础设施集成测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/infrastructure-integration-tests","wordCount":1070,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"基础设施集成测试\">基础设施集成测试</h1><p>单元测试验证单个模块在隔离环境中的行为；集成测试则验证多个模块组合后在真实云环境中的<em>交互效果</em>。一个安全组规则在单独看时完全正确，但当它与路由表、网络 ACL 和 VPC endpoint 策略组合时，实际流量路径可能与预期完全不同。这正是集成测试存在的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>集成测试</strong>：验证多个模块组合后在真实云环境中的交互效果</li>\n<li><strong>Deploy-Validate-Destroy</strong>：创建资源 → 验证行为 → 销毁一切的标准测试模式</li>\n<li><strong>Fixture-Based 测试</strong>：共享基础设施避免重复创建的优化模式</li>\n<li><strong>暂态 vs 持久错误</strong>：区分需要重试的 API 超时和需要立即失败的权限错误</li>\n<li><strong>并行执行</strong>：<code>t.Parallel()</code> + 独立命名空间实现测试并发</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"集成测试的范围界定\">集成测试的范围界定</h2><p>集成测试不等于端到端测试。两者的区别在于范围：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>集成测试</th>\n<th>端到端测试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范围</td>\n<td>2-5 个紧耦合模块</td>\n<td>完整环境（网络+计算+存储+安全）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源数</td>\n<td>5-20</td>\n<td>50+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行时间</td>\n<td>5-15 分钟</td>\n<td>30-60 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证焦点</td>\n<td>模块间接口与交互</td>\n<td>业务场景的端到端路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发时机</td>\n<td>每个 PR</td>\n<td>合并到 main / 定时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"集成测试的核心模式\">集成测试的核心模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式一-deploy-validate-destroy\">模式一：Deploy-Validate-Destroy</h3><p>最经典的集成测试模式。在测试开始时创建资源，验证行为，然后销毁一切：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func TestNetworkIntegration(t *testing.T) {&#10;    t.Parallel()&#10;&#10;    uniqueID := random.UniqueId()&#10;    terraformOptions := &amp;terraform.Options{&#10;        TerraformDir: &quot;../live/network&quot;,&#10;        Vars: map[string]interface{}{&#10;            &quot;test_id&quot;:     uniqueID,&#10;            &quot;environment&quot;: &quot;integration-test&quot;,&#10;        },&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    defer terraform.Destroy(t, terraformOptions)&#10;    terraform.InitAndApply(t, terraformOptions)&#10;&#10;    // 验证 VPC 与子网创建&#10;    vpcID := terraform.Output(t, terraformOptions, &quot;vpc_id&quot;)&#10;    publicSubnetIDs := terraform.OutputList(t, terraformOptions, &quot;public_subnet_ids&quot;)&#10;    privateSubnetIDs := terraform.OutputList(t, terraformOptions, &quot;private_subnet_ids&quot;)&#10;&#10;    // 验证子网路由：公有子网有 IGW 路由&#10;    for _, subnetID := range publicSubnetIDs {&#10;        routeTable := aws.GetRouteTableForSubnet(t, subnetID, &quot;us-east-1&quot;)&#10;        assert.True(t, hasInternetGatewayRoute(routeTable))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 验证子网路由：私有子网有 NAT 路由但无 IGW&#10;    for _, subnetID := range privateSubnetIDs {&#10;        routeTable := aws.GetRouteTableForSubnet(t, subnetID, &quot;us-east-1&quot;)&#10;        assert.True(t, hasNATGatewayRoute(routeTable))&#10;        assert.False(t, hasInternetGatewayRoute(routeTable))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestNetworkIntegration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Parallel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    uniqueID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UniqueId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    terraformOptions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">terraform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        TerraformDir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../live/network\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Vars: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"test_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:     uniqueID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"environment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"integration-test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terraform.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Destroy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, terraformOptions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    terraform.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">InitAndApply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, terraformOptions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证 VPC 与子网创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vpcID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terraform.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, terraformOptions, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vpc_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    publicSubnetIDs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terraform.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OutputList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, terraformOptions, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"public_subnet_ids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    privateSubnetIDs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terraform.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OutputList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, terraformOptions, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"private_subnet_ids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证子网路由：公有子网有 IGW 路由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, subnetID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> publicSubnetIDs {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        routeTable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetRouteTableForSubnet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, subnetID, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"us-east-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hasInternetGatewayRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(routeTable))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证子网路由：私有子网有 NAT 路由但无 IGW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, subnetID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> privateSubnetIDs {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        routeTable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetRouteTableForSubnet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, subnetID, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"us-east-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hasNATGatewayRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(routeTable))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hasInternetGatewayRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(routeTable))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式二-fixture-based-测试\">模式二：Fixture-Based 测试</h3><p>对于需要共享基础设施（如 VPC）的多组测试，使用 fixture 模式避免重复创建：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Setup Fixture: 创建 VPC] --&gt; B[Test 1: 安全组规则]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Test 2: 子网路由]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Test 3: VPC Endpoint]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Teardown Fixture: 销毁 VPC]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E\">graph TD\n    A[Setup Fixture: 创建 VPC] --&gt; B[Test 1: 安全组规则]\n    A --&gt; C[Test 2: 子网路由]\n    A --&gt; D[Test 3: VPC Endpoint]\n    B --&gt; E[Teardown Fixture: 销毁 VPC]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E</pre><h3 id=\"模式三-增量验证\">模式三：增量验证</h3><p>对于长时间运行的环境（如 staging），使用增量验证而非每次全量创建/销毁：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>对已存在的环境运行 <code>terraform plan</code></li>\n<li>应用变更</li>\n<li>验证变更后的状态</li>\n<li>不销毁（环境持续存在）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"典型集成测试场景\">典型集成测试场景</h2><h3 id=\"场景一-网络模块组合\">场景一：网络模块组合</h3><p>验证 VPC + Subnets + NAT Gateway + Security Groups 的组合行为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证点</th>\n<th>断言</th>\n<th>验证方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>公有子网可达外网</td>\n<td>从子网内 EC2 能 curl 外部 URL</td>\n<td>SSH + curl</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有子网经 NAT 出网</td>\n<td>从私有 EC2 能访问外网</td>\n<td>SSH + curl</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有子网不可被外网访问</td>\n<td>从外部无法连接私有 IP</td>\n<td>端口扫描超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全组规则生效</td>\n<td>只允许 443 端口入站</td>\n<td>多端口连接测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"场景二-计算-存储组合\">场景二：计算 + 存储组合</h3><p>验证 EC2/ECS + EBS/EFS 的挂载与权限：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func TestComputeStorageIntegration(t *testing.T) {&#10;    // ... setup ...&#10;&#10;    instanceIP := terraform.Output(t, opts, &quot;instance_public_ip&quot;)&#10;&#10;    // 验证 EFS 挂载成功&#10;    output := ssh.CheckSshCommand(t, instanceIP, &quot;df -h | grep efs&quot;)&#10;    assert.Contains(t, output, &quot;/mnt/efs&quot;)&#10;&#10;    // 验证写入权限&#10;    ssh.CheckSshCommand(t, instanceIP, &quot;touch /mnt/efs/test-file&quot;)&#10;&#10;    // 验证跨 AZ 访问（第二个实例也能读到）&#10;    instance2IP := terraform.Output(t, opts, &quot;instance_2_public_ip&quot;)&#10;    output2 := ssh.CheckSshCommand(t, instance2IP, &quot;ls /mnt/efs/test-file&quot;)&#10;    assert.Contains(t, output2, &quot;test-file&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestComputeStorageIntegration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ... setup ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    instanceIP </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terraform.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, opts, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"instance_public_ip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证 EFS 挂载成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ssh.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CheckSshCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, instanceIP, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"df -h | grep efs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Contains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, output, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/mnt/efs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证写入权限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ssh.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CheckSshCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, instanceIP, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"touch /mnt/efs/test-file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证跨 AZ 访问（第二个实例也能读到）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    instance2IP </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terraform.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, opts, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"instance_2_public_ip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    output2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ssh.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CheckSshCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, instance2IP, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ls /mnt/efs/test-file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Contains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, output2, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"test-file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"场景三-iam-资源策略组合\">场景三：IAM + 资源策略组合</h3><p>验证 IAM 角色策略与资源策略（如 S3 桶策略）的组合效果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∩</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∪</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Access = IAM_{allow} \\cap Resource_{allow} - (IAM_{deny} \\cup Resource_{deny})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ccess</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">eso</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">eso</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>IAM 的最终权限是 IAM 策略与资源策略的<strong>交集</strong>减去任何显式拒绝。集成测试通过实际 API 调用验证这一组合逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集成测试的时间优化\">集成测试的时间优化</h2><p>集成测试的主要成本是等待资源创建。优化策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[串行执行] --&gt;|15分钟×5| B[总计75分钟]&#10;    C[并行执行] --&gt;|15分钟÷5| D[总计约18分钟]&#10;    E[依赖感知并行] --&gt;|关键路径| F[总计约25分钟]\">graph LR\n    A[串行执行] --&gt;|15分钟×5| B[总计75分钟]\n    C[并行执行] --&gt;|15分钟÷5| D[总计约18分钟]\n    E[依赖感知并行] --&gt;|关键路径| F[总计约25分钟]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>并行测试</strong>：独立的测试用例使用 <code>t.Parallel()</code> 并行执行</li>\n<li><strong>最小资源集</strong>：只创建验证目标所需的最少资源</li>\n<li><strong>异步等待</strong>：使用重试 + 超时模式等待资源就绪，而非固定 sleep</li>\n<li><strong>共享 fixtures</strong>：多个测试共用同一组基础资源</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理与重试策略\">错误处理与重试策略</h2><p>云 API 的最终一致性和暂态错误要求集成测试具备重试能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Terratest 的重试模式&#10;maxRetries := 10&#10;sleepBetweenRetries := 10 * time.Second&#10;&#10;http_helper.HttpGetWithRetryWithCustomValidation(&#10;    t,&#10;    fmt.Sprintf(&quot;https://%s/health&quot;, albDNS),&#10;    nil,&#10;    maxRetries,&#10;    sleepBetweenRetries,&#10;    func(statusCode int, body string) bool {&#10;        return statusCode == 200&#10;    },&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Terratest 的重试模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">maxRetries </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sleepBetweenRetries </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">http_helper.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HttpGetWithRetryWithCustomValidation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/health\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, albDNS),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxRetries,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sleepBetweenRetries,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">statusCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statusCode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>区分暂态错误（需重试）与持久错误（立即失败）是测试可靠性的关键。暂态错误包括：API 限流（429）、资源创建中（pending）、DNS 传播延迟。持久错误包括：权限不足（403）、配置冲突（409）、资源不存在（404）。</p>\n<p>关于如何验证网络层面的连通性细节，参见 <a href=\"network-connectivity-testing\">网络连通性测试</a>。关于测试环境的隔离与成本管理，参见 <a href=\"../foundations/testing-environments-strategies\">测试环境与策略</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>基础设施集成测试通过在真实云环境中验证模块组合的交互效果，填补了单元测试和端到端测试之间的验证空白。Deploy-Validate-Destroy 是核心模式，Fixture-Based 和增量验证是其在不同场景下的变体。重试策略、并行执行和范围控制是保证集成测试可靠性和效率的关键工程实践。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基础设施集成测试","id":"基础设施集成测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"集成测试的范围界定","id":"集成测试的范围界定"},{"level":2,"text":"集成测试的核心模式","id":"集成测试的核心模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：Deploy-Validate-Destroy","id":"模式一-deploy-validate-destroy"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：Fixture-Based 测试","id":"模式二-fixture-based-测试"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：增量验证","id":"模式三-增量验证"},{"level":2,"text":"典型集成测试场景","id":"典型集成测试场景"},{"level":3,"text":"场景一：网络模块组合","id":"场景一-网络模块组合"},{"level":3,"text":"场景二：计算 + 存储组合","id":"场景二-计算-存储组合"},{"level":3,"text":"场景三：IAM + 资源策略组合","id":"场景三-iam-资源策略组合"},{"level":2,"text":"集成测试的时间优化","id":"集成测试的时间优化"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理与重试策略","id":"错误处理与重试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"容器镜像测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/container-image-testing"},"next":{"title":"网络连通性测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/network-connectivity-testing"}}